{"doi":"10.3390/e24020301","arxiv_id":"2207.06415","version":"arXiv full text cross-checked with Entropy review","title":"The Free Energy Principle for Perception and Action: A Deep Learning Perspective","authors":["Pietro Mazzaglia","Tim Verbelen","Ozan Çatal","Bart Dhoedt"],"journal":"Entropy","volume":"24","pages":"301","published":"2022","abstract":"A review maps variational and expected free energy to deep generative world-model learning and several amortized active-inference action-selection designs.","comment":"Review article; not a new experimental benchmark"},
[sec("作者信息","作者 Pietro Mazzaglia、Tim Verbelen、Ozan Çatal、Bart Dhoedt；Entropy 24, 301 (2022)，DOI:10.3390/e24020301。核验 arXiv:2207.06415 全文21页；文章性质为综述/实践指南。"),
sec("研究问题","free-energy principle与active inference的数学表述如何转译为深度学习工程组件？在world-model学习、uncertainty、representation、amortization、preferences、epistemic value和planning之间有哪些可选设计，而它们与RL/VAE术语如何对应？"),
sec("背景","variational free energy是sensory surprisal的可计算upper bound，优化approximate posterior同时学习generative model。expected free energy用于未来policy评估，结合preferred outcomes与information gain。","FEP作为生物理论有强假设和争议；本文目标是组织已有计算实现，不是通过新实验证明大脑必然最小化某个特定自由能。"),
sec("模型与方法","Figure 1把过去经验的variational inference与未来行为的expected-free-energy selection分成两条链。作者以POMDP/generative model写出observations、latent states、actions、transition、likelihood和preferences。","综述比较VAE-style posterior/decoder、deterministic或stochastic dynamics、hierarchical/memory representations，以及explicit planning、amortized policy、habit learning和tree search。Tables 1–2汇总实现choices。"),
sec("核心结果与证据","核心产出不是benchmark，而是设计空间：Figure 3给active-inference graphical model；Figure 4连接world models/representation learning；Figure 5比较plan selection、amortized action和habit/search。","文章澄清active-inference preferences不是RL中外加的瞬时reward，而是generative model期望频繁访问的outcomes；但二者可在特定control-as-inference形式下建立数学对应。","所列算法跨不同任务、评价和假设，不能由综述直接排出普遍优劣。Figure 1适合作为阅读地图，而非性能证据。"),
sec("有效性与局限","综述截至2022，后续world models、diffusion policies和large-scale agents不在范围。不同论文使用的free-energy符号、precision与epistemic terms可能不等价。","FEP的宽泛版本可能难falsify；实际实现仍需指定state model、preferences、horizon和approximation。文章未提供统一代码、同任务reimplementation或controlled empirical comparison。"),
sec("复现与资源","全文：https://arxiv.org/abs/2207.06415；期刊：https://doi.org/10.3390/e24020301。PDF SHA-256：1e8a749aa370ed0189cbb610d9904643e048daac0beda407d1065b75475bbc3d。综述没有单一伴随代码仓库。","复核应分别追踪VFE与EFE定义、KL方向、preference distribution和policy posterior；实现时记录latent dynamics、uncertainty estimator、planning horizon与baselines。Evidence status: full-text verified review; no independent reproduction performed."),
sec("阅读指南","先读 p.1 Figure 1总览；pp.2–5 VFE/EFE；pp.5–12看world-model设计；pp.12–17看action selection与Figure 5；pp.17–21为讨论与参考文献。")],
