[sec("作者信息","作者 Matthew Golden、Roman O. Grigoriev、Jyothishraj Nambisan、Alberto Fernández-Nieves；Science Advances 9, eabq6120 (2023)，DOI:10.1126/sciadv.abq6120。核验 arXiv:2202.12853 全文22页。"),
sec("研究问题","现有Leslie–Ericksen/Beris–Edwards active-nematic models有许多难测参数，且可能不适合油水界面上的microtubule bundles。能否直接由实验director、velocity和order fields发现闭合、稀疏、可解释的PDE relations及系数？"),
sec("背景","topological defects使director n不能全局连续，因此使用Q_ij=S n_i n_j及density/order proxy φ。SPIDER先用symmetry、tensor rank和derivative order生成候选terms，再以weak integral form降低实验微分噪声。","发现的是给定observables和library下的effective continuum relations；遗漏变量可能被吸收到系数或低阶terms中。"),
sec("模型与方法","对每种目标tensor/scalar relation，随机选择space-time integration domains，以smooth test functions把derivatives转移出noisy fields，构造feature matrix。iterative sparse regression沿residual–complexity Pareto curve删除terms。","候选模型用独立domains和symmetry tests验证，并从weak coefficients恢复strong form。原始荧光MT images、PIV velocity、Q/φ fields及confidence weights共同限定可靠区域。"),
sec("核心结果与证据","Figures 2–3展示SPIDER feature construction与稀疏selection。Figure 4比较identified strong-form terms的spatial fields：incompressibility近似成立，orientation transport与active/viscous/friction stresses在可靠区域相互平衡。","发现的结构类似经典active nematics，但该实验中elastic terms未被选中；动力学主要由active stress与friction/viscous response控制。Figure 5量化不同relations residual并显示defects附近误差更大。","‘elasticity不起作用’限定于此dataset、分辨率、library与operating regime；未选择不等于微观elasticity严格为零。"),
sec("有效性与局限","velocity/director reconstruction和mask会系统影响terms；weak form减少noise却牺牲local resolution。候选库、maximum derivative/nonlinearity order和sparsity threshold构成强inductive bias。","只有一个主要experimental platform/regime，缺少外部预测experiment和perturbation validation。识别relations可能因feature collinearity不唯一，作者用多个domains和residual hierarchy缓解但未完全消除。"),
sec("复现与资源","全文：https://arxiv.org/abs/2202.12853；期刊：https://doi.org/10.1126/sciadv.abq6120；MATLAB代码：https://github.com/mgolden30/SPIDER_active_nematics。PDF SHA-256：9d7fcd44ff136b0c0d717740164b7ccde7c1beecdb654bd32b86b2fa3b162f8c。","复现需固定field extraction、confidence masks、library table、weak-domain sizes/test functions、normalization、deletion path和model-selection elbow；应保留raw-to-field provenance。Evidence status: full-text verified theory/experiment study; no independent reproduction performed."),
sec("阅读指南","先读 pp.1–3 Figure 1与observables；pp.3–6 Figures 2–3看SPIDER；pp.6–9 Figures 4–5看发现方程；pp.10–16读methods；pp.17–22为supplementary推导。")],
"figure-4-identified-fields.webp","Figure 4",7,"field_map","实验snapshot上identified strong-form relation各项的空间场对比。","观测到的active、viscous与friction terms在可靠区域形成局部平衡，而经典elastic项未进入稀疏模型。","Figure 4把抽象稀疏方程映回真实实验空间，是判断各物理项是否解释数据的中心图证。",
